      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "occult",
        "spirit"
      ],
      "text": "30 feet. The spirits bound by a spirit binder swirl around, lashing out at their foes. An enemy that enters or starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 27 Will save save or take 3d6 spirit damage and be Frightened 1 (double damage and Frightened 2 on a critical failure).",
      "rules": [
